BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:karpathos-othos-carnival-court-of-othos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270315
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270316
SUMMARY:Carnival court of Othos
LOCATION:Othos\, Karpathos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On Clean Monday the village of Othos stages a mock 'court' with masqueraders (the mousoutades) trying and sentencing villagers for the year's misdeeds\, followed by traditional dances. It is the best-known carnival custom on Karpathos\, and the only reason many islanders come home in winter. Dress warmly\; Othos is at 500 m.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#othos-carnival-court-of-othos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#othos-carnival-court-of-othos
END:VEVENT
