UID:karpathos-pigadia-panigiri-of-panagia-evangelistria-pigadia-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270324
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270326
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Evangelistria\, Pigadia
LOCATION:Pigadia\, Karpathos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island capital's own feast\, on Annunciation day: liturgy and procession at Evangelistria in Pigadia\, then a town-wide glendi. Olympos marks the same day. A good reason to be on Karpathos out of season\, and the ferries run.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#pigadia-panigiri-of-panagia-evangelistria-pigadia
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#pigadia-panigiri-of-panagia-evangelistria-pigadia
END:VEVENT
